        <keyword>종류와</keyword>
        <keyword>색상</keyword>
        <keyword>옳게</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>유류화재 － 황색</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 재난관리론 · 화재의 종류와 색상
정답은 ②이다. 화재 표시색은 일반화재(A급) 백색, 유류화재(B급) 황색, 전기화재(C급) 청색, 금속화재(D급) 무색이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>금속화재 － 청색</choice_text>
          <commentary>금속화재는 무색이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>유류화재 － 황색</choice_text>
          <commentary>유류화재 − 황색이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>일반화재 － 무색</choice_text>
          <commentary>일반화재는 백색이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>전기화재 － 백색</choice_text>
          <commentary>전기화재는 청색이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
