    <question_explanation no="7" id="PRB-94046DC9CE8DD998-Q7">
      <question_stem>재난관리에 대한 위험도(Risk) 계산식이다. (가)에 들어갈 내용은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="빈칸/기호 추론형" category="수리·계산·자료해석형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>재난관리</keyword>
        <keyword>재난관리에 대한 위험도(Risk)</keyword>
        <keyword>위험도(Risk)</keyword>
        <keyword>위해성(Hazard)</keyword>
        <keyword>취약성(Vulnerability)</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>재난관리(Disaster Management)</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 재난관리론 · 위험도 계산식
정답은 ③이다. 위험도(Risk)는 위해성과 취약성의 곱에 비례하고 재난관리 능력에 반비례하므로 Risk = Hazard × Vulnerability / Disaster Management로 나타낸다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>노출성(Exposure)</choice_text>
          <commentary>노출성은 분모에 오지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>복잡성(Complexity)</choice_text>
          <commentary>복잡성은 계산식 요소가 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>재난관리(Disaster Management)</choice_text>
          <commentary>재난관리(능력)이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>재앙(Calamity)</choice_text>
          <commentary>재앙은 계산식 요소가 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
